ht":25},{"text":"Usage","x":806,"y":1171,"width":87,"height":25}]},{"text":"운영체제는 종종 카운%l(counting)과 이진(binary) 세마포를 구분한다. 기은팅 세마포","words":[{"text":"운영체제는","x":308,"y":1232,"width":150,"height":34},{"text":"종종","x":468,"y":1235,"width":59,"height":33},{"text":"카운%l(counting)과","x":538,"y":1232,"width":267,"height":39},{"text":"이진(binary)","x":818,"y":1232,"width":176,"height":40},{"text":"세마포를","x":1009,"y":1233,"width":121,"height":34},{"text":"구분한다.","x":1142,"y":1233,"width":134,"height":34},{"text":"기은팅","x":1292,"y":1233,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"세마포","x":1401,"y":1233,"width":93,"height":34}]},{"text":"의 값은 제한 없는 영역(domain)을 갖는다. 이진 세마포의 값은 0과 1사이의 값만 가","words":[{"text":"의","x":309,"y":1289,"width":27,"height":34},{"text":"값은","x":353,"y":1289,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"제한","x":426,"y":1290,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"없는","x":497,"y":1291,"width":57,"height":33},{"text":"영역(domain)을","x":568,"y":1289,"width":219,"height":38},{"text":"갖는다.","x":800,"y":1289,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"이진","x":911,"y":1290,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"세마포의","x":981,"y":1289,"width":118,"height":35},{"text":"값은","x":1117,"y":1290,"width":62,"height":33},{"text":"0과","x":1192,"y":1290,"width":52,"height":34},{"text":"1사이의","x":1258,"y":1290,"width":111,"height":34},{"text":"값만","x":1388,"y":1290,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"가","x":1465,"y":1290,"width":30,"height":34}]},{"text":"능하다. 따라서 이진 세마포는 mutex 락과 유사하게 동작한다. 사실 몇몇 시스템에서는","words":[{"text":"능하다.","x":309,"y":1346,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"따라서","x":418,"y":1347,"width":84,"height":34},{"text":"이진","x":517,"y":1348,"width":55,"height":34},{"text":"세마포는","x":584,"y":1347,"width":113,"height":34},{"text":"mutex","x":707,"y":1353,"width":93,"height":23},{"text":"락과","x":813,"y":1346,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"유사하게","x":881,"y":1346,"width":116,"height":35},{"text":"동작한다.","x":1011,"y":1346,"width":128,"height":34},{"text":"사실","x":1153,"y":1346,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"몇몇","x"